---
/**
 * Development showcase. Proof is Shinobi, the child-brand video site.
 * No client domains. No invented results.
 */
const shinobi = "https://shinobiseo.netlify.app";
---

<section class="studio" id="workbench" data-studio>
  <div class="page-container studio-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Working sample</p>
    <h2>Shinobi is the <span>build we actually shipped</span></h2>
    <p>
      Shinobi is our Philippines creative-industry SEO studio. Full-bleed hero video, manga paper and ink UI, TanStack routes, a painted lockup in the header, and a separate Facebook card. Bright Forge is the parent. If it is not on the live site, it is not in this story.
    </p>
    <p><a href={shinobi}>Open Shinobi</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="hud-marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hud-track">
      <span>HERO VIDEO</span><span>MANGA UI</span><span>TANSTACK</span><span>CASES</span><span>STUDIO</span><span>PARENT</span><span>OG CARD</span><span>HERO VIDEO</span><span>MANGA UI</span><span>TANSTACK</span><span>CASES</span><span>STUDIO</span><span>PARENT</span><span>OG CARD</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container crawl-wrap">
    <div class="hud-corners" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="crawl-head">
      <p class="crawl-kicker">Shinobi routes a crawler can follow</p>
      <p class="hud-status">VIDEO.LIVE · PATH.ESTABLISHED</p>
      <div class="radar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
    </div>
    <svg class="crawl-map" viewBox="0 0 720 210" role="img" aria-label="Crawler moving through Shinobi Home, Cases, Studio, Services and Contact">
      <path class="crawl-track" d="M80 110 C 180 40, 250 40, 360 110 S 540 180, 640 110" fill="none" />
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(80 110)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Home</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(220 62)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Cases</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(360 110)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Studio</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(500 158)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Services</text>
      </g>
      <g class="crawl-node" transform="translate(640 110)">
        <circle r="7" /><text y="28">Contact</text>
      </g>
      <circle class="crawler" r="6" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container studio-grid">
    <article class="reel" aria-label="Live Shinobi site demo">
      <header class="workbench-bar">
        <span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="workbench-title">shinobiseo.netlify.app</span>
        <span class="live-pill">live</span>
      </header>
      <iframe
        class="reel-frame"
        src={`${shinobi}/`}
        title="Shinobi live site"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
      ></iframe>
    </article>

    <article class="build-portfolio" aria-label="Interactive Shinobi build portfolio">
      <p class="frame-label">Explore the build</p>
      <h3>Four decisions behind the live Shinobi site</h3>
      <div class="portfolio-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Shinobi build decisions">
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-hero" aria-controls="panel-hero" aria-selected="true" data-demo-tab="hero">01 Hero</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-stack" aria-controls="panel-stack" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-demo-tab="stack">02 TanStack + Tailwind</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-manga" aria-controls="panel-manga" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-demo-tab="manga">03 Manga UI</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-seo" aria-controls="panel-seo" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-demo-tab="seo">04 SEO + handoff</button>
      </div>

      <div class="portfolio-stage">
        <section id="panel-hero" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-hero" data-demo-panel="hero">
          <p class="portfolio-number">01 / Hero system</p>
          <h4>The video builds the world. The copy still sells the job.</h4>
          <p>We used a full-bleed <code>hero.mp4</code> with a poster and muted loop to make Shinobi feel like a creative studio before the visitor reads a word. A manga-paper wash protects contrast, while the H1 stays plain and commercial: “The phone has to ring. Not just the report.”</p>
          <div class="portfolio-points"><span>Full-bleed video</span><span>Readable H1</span><span>Mobile poster</span><span>Reduced-motion safe</span></div>
        </section>

        <section id="panel-stack" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-stack" data-demo-panel="stack" hidden>
          <p class="portfolio-number">02 / Technology</p>
          <h4>TanStack Start for real routes. Tailwind for a custom visual system.</h4>
          <p>Shinobi is not an Astro build. We chose TanStack Start because the site needed React components, route-led pages and room to grow into interactive tools without becoming a one-page app. Tailwind let us build the ink borders, paper layers, stamps and responsive states as a consistent system instead of fighting a purchased theme.</p>
          <div class="portfolio-points"><span>TanStack Start</span><span>React 19</span><span>Tailwind CSS</span><span>Nitro deployment</span></div>
        </section>

        <section id="panel-manga" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-manga" data-demo-panel="manga" hidden>
          <p class="portfolio-number">03 / Art direction</p>
          <h4>Manga made sense for the audience. It was not decoration pasted on later.</h4>
          <p>Shinobi targets creative-industry businesses, so a normal agency grid would have made the brand forgettable. We built the interface around ink borders, speech panels, paper texture, a painted lockup and a red 参上 stamp. The style carries through navigation, cards and calls to action rather than appearing only in the hero.</p>
          <div class="portfolio-points"><span>Ink borders</span><span>Paper texture</span><span>Painted lockup</span><span>Consistent components</span></div>
        </section>

        <section id="panel-seo" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-seo" data-demo-panel="seo" hidden>
          <p class="portfolio-number">04 / Search and ownership</p>
          <h4>The creative idea still had to ship as a crawlable business site.</h4>
          <p>Home, cases, studio, services, industries, development, blog, about and contact are real routes. Titles and H1s do different jobs. Bright Forge is labelled as the parent, the Open Graph image uses an absolute URL, and the contact path stays on the same domain. The result can be crawled, shared and handed over.</p>
          <div class="portfolio-points"><span>Real routes</span><span>Title + H1</span><span>Parent labelled</span><span>Absolute OG card</span></div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container jobs-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we actually built on Shinobi</p>
    <h2>Not a theme. A <span>full studio site</span></h2>
    <div class="jobs">
      <article class="job job-wide">
        <h3>Hero video that still ranks as a document</h3>
        <p>Full-bleed <code>hero.mp4</code>, poster, and a paper wash so the H1 stays readable on a phone. Motion is costume. The commercial line is still “the phone has to ring”.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>Manga system, not a template</h3>
        <p>Ink borders, speech panels, 参上 stamp, painted lockup. Header logo is the lockup without sunburst rays. Facebook keeps the painted OG card.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>TanStack routes</h3>
        <p>Home, cases, studio, SEO services, industries, development, blog, work, about, contact. Real URLs, not a one-page scroll.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>Parent proof, labelled</h3>
        <p>Bright Forge is named as the parent. Reused case metrics stay labelled as parent work. No invented percentages.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="job">
        <h3>Share card that Facebook can scrape</h3>
        <p>Hardcoded absolute <code>og.jpg</code>. Nav does not use that file. Two jobs, two assets.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-container launch-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Launch sheet</p>
      <h2>Shinobi does not ship until <span>this list is true</span></h2>
      <p>Same pass we run on a client build. This one is ours, so we can show it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="launch-sheet">
      <li><span>01</span> Hero video and poster on the live host</li>
      <li><span>02</span> Title and H1 do different work</li>
      <li><span>03</span> Routes return 200: cases, studio, services, contact</li>
      <li><span>04</span> Parent company named and linked</li>
      <li><span>05</span> Header lockup is not the Facebook card</li>
      <li><span>06</span> OG image is an absolute URL</li>
      <li><span>07</span> Contact form on the same domain</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const studio = document.querySelector('[data-studio]');
  if (studio && !window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) studio.classList.add('is-live');
        });
      },
      { threshold: 0.2 }
    );
    io.observe(studio);
  } else if (studio) {
    studio.classList.add('is-live');
    studio.querySelectorAll('video').forEach((v) => v.pause());
  }
  if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-studio] video').forEach((v) => v.removeAttribute('autoplay'));
  }

  if (studio) {
    const tabs = Array.from(studio.querySelectorAll('[data-demo-tab]'));
    const panels = Array.from(studio.querySelectorAll('[data-demo-panel]'));
    const activateTab = (tab) => {
      const target = tab.getAttribute('data-demo-tab');
      tabs.forEach((item) => {
        const active = item === tab;
        item.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(active));
        item.setAttribute('tabindex', active ? '0' : '-1');
      });
      panels.forEach((panel) => {
        panel.hidden = panel.getAttribute('data-demo-panel') !== target;
      });
    };
    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => activateTab(tab));
      tab.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => {
        if (event.key !== 'ArrowRight' && event.key !== 'ArrowLeft') return;
        event.preventDefault();
        const step = event.key === 'ArrowRight' ? 1 : -1;
        const next = tabs[(index + step + tabs.length) % tabs.length];
        activateTab(next);
        next.focus();
      });
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .studio {
    padding: 0 0 40px;
    background: #0d0f1a;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .studio .page-container {
    width: min(100% - 40px, 1120px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .studio-intro { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .hud-marquee {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-block: 1px solid rgba(240,98,42,.25);
    background: #0a0c16;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    width: min(100% - 40px, 1120px);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 0;
  }
  .hud-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.4rem;
    width: max-content;
    animation: ticker 22s linear infinite;
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .28em;
    color: rgba(240,98,42,.85);
  }
  .hud-track span { white-space: nowrap; }
  .studio .page-container.crawl-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0 auto 44px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(240,98,42,.08), transparent 42%),
      #12162a;
    padding: 18px 18px 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hud-corners {
    pointer-events: none;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 8px;
    border: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top left / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top left / 2px 18px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top right / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) top right / 2px 18px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom left / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom left / 2px 18px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom right / 18px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(#f0622a,#f0622a) bottom right / 2px 18px no-repeat;
  }
  .crawl-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto auto;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .hud-status {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.45);
    font-size: .68rem;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  }
  .radar {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(240,98,42,.45);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle, rgba(240,98,42,.2) 2px, transparent 3px),
      repeating-radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 7px, rgba(240,98,42,.2) 7px 8px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .radar i {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0 280deg, rgba(240,98,42,.55) 320deg, transparent 360deg);
    animation: sweep 3.2s linear infinite;
  }
  .crawl-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #f0622a;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .crawl-map { width: 100%; max-height: 200px; height: auto; display: block; }
  .crawl-track {
    stroke: rgba(240,98,42,.45);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 8 10;
    animation: dash 18s linear infinite;
  }
  .crawl-node circle { fill: #1c2136; stroke: #f0622a; stroke-width: 2; }
  .crawl-node text {
    fill: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-anchor: middle;
    font-family: Outfit, system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .crawler {
    fill: #f0622a;
    offset-path: path('M80 110 C 180 40, 250 40, 360 110 S 540 180, 640 110');
    offset-distance: 0%;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px #f0622a);
  }
  .studio.is-live .crawler { animation: crawl 7.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .studio .page-container.studio-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
    margin: 0 auto 64px;
  }
  .reel { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .studio .page-container.launch-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    margin: 0 auto 72px;
  }
  .launch-grid h2 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .launch-grid p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 72ch;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .workbench,
  .build-portfolio,
  .job,
  .launch-sheet {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    background: #14182a;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
  }
  .workbench, .reel { border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  .reel {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    background: #14182a;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 0;
  }
  .reel-frame {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(560px, 72vh, 760px);
    border: 0;
    background: #0a0c16;
  }
  .build-portfolio { border-radius: 16px; padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px); }
  .workbench-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: #1c2136;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    font-size: .78rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
  }
  .live-pill {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #7dffb3;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: .64rem;
  }
  .studio.is-live .live-pill { animation: pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .dots {
    width: 38px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 5px 5px, #f0622a 4px, transparent 5px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 19px 5px, #c9a227 4px, transparent 5px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 33px 5px, #3d8bfd 4px, transparent 5px);
  }
  .build-log {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 8px 0 12px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: .86rem;
  }
  .build-log li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    opacity: .22;
    transform: translateX(-8px);
  }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li {
    animation: log-in .5s ease forwards;
  }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .15s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .45s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .75s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.05s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 1.35s; }
  .studio.is-live .build-log li:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 1.65s; }
  .build-log code {
    min-width: 2.6rem;
    color: #7dffb3;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .build-log li:last-child code { color: #f0622a; }
  .frame-label {
    color: #f0622a;
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .build-portfolio > h3 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.15rem);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .portfolio-tabs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .portfolio-tabs button {
    min-height: 54px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #0e1221;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.62);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: .82rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease, color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }
  .portfolio-tabs button:hover,
  .portfolio-tabs button:focus-visible {
    border-color: rgba(240,98,42,.7);
    color: #fff;
    outline: none;
  }
  .portfolio-tabs button[aria-selected="true"] {
    border-color: #f0622a;
    background: rgba(240,98,42,.14);
    color: #fff;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .portfolio-stage {
    min-height: 310px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 42px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(240,98,42,.22);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(240,98,42,.12), transparent 34%),
      #0e1221;
  }
  .portfolio-stage section[hidden] { display: none; }
  .portfolio-number {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: #f0622a;
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .portfolio-stage h4 {
    max-width: 25ch;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .portfolio-stage section > p:not(.portfolio-number) {
    max-width: 78ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }
  .portfolio-points {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .portfolio-points span {
    border: 1px solid rgba(240,98,42,.35);
    color: #f3c2a8;
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .studio .page-container.jobs-block { margin: 0 auto 88px; }
  .jobs-block h2 { margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .jobs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .job { padding: 28px 28px 32px; border-radius: 16px; }
  .job-wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: 32px; }
  .job h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.12rem; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .job p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); line-height: 1.7; }
  .launch-sheet {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .launch-sheet li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px 22px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.86);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }
  .launch-sheet span {
    color: #f0622a;
    font-weight: 800;
    min-width: 1.6rem;
  }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li {
    animation: tick .4s ease forwards;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .2s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .35s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .5s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: .65s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: .8s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: .95s; }
  .studio.is-live .launch-sheet li:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 1.1s; }
  @keyframes crawl {
    0% { offset-distance: 0%; }
    100% { offset-distance: 100%; }
  }
  @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -180; } }
  @keyframes log-in { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes reveal { to { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); } }
  @keyframes stamp { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  @keyframes tick { to { opacity: 1; } }
  @keyframes pulse {
    50% { opacity: .35; }
  }
  @keyframes ticker { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
  @keyframes sweep { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .studio-grid, .launch-grid, .jobs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .portfolio-tabs { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
